---
Title: images LaTeX cannot include
Video poster: none
---

A markdown image of an SVG with nothing beside it becomes a link in LaTeX:
![A vector drawing](figs/drawing.svg)

So does a remote one: ![A remote picture](https://example.com/picture.png)

An ordinary image is still included: ![A plain picture](figs/plain.png)

A video whose poster is an SVG falls back to its caption:

@video+(tiny.mp4)[A short clip]{poster=still.svg width=0.3}
